+File.write(dest+'/SUMMARY.json',JSON.pretty_generate(summary)+"\n")
+journal.close
+puts JSON.generate(summary)

codex
The fresh identity/type and memo checks pass. I also added a native checker for the nine R27 policy rows, replacing their reliance on the prior `jq` result. It admits the exact policy hash before inspecting the arrays and refuses changed policy bytes. The search now includes renamed files and local Git blobs.

